                                                        <strong><span style="color:red">New Fixed Interview Pricing Policy- </span></strong> <a id="documentid" target="_blank" title="New Interview Policy" href="https://risebirdportal.blob.core.windows.net/template/NewInterviewPricingPolicy.pdf">Click here</a>
                                                         <br />
